OpenCV: ORB's learned rBRIEF test pattern
-----------------------------------------

What:   the 256 test pairs `bit_pattern_31_`, from OpenCV's modules/features2d/src/orb.cpp
        (authors Ethan Rublee, Vincent Rabaud, Gary Bradski).
Where:  PATTERN in src/slamlab/foundations/orb.py; kPattern in
        cpp/include/slamlab/foundations/orb.hpp; PATTERN in
        rust/slamlab-foundations/src/orb.rs. Each copy carries this notice beside it.
Source: https://github.com/opencv/opencv/blob/4.x/modules/features2d/src/orb.cpp
